<li class="fund-point flex items-center gap-4 rounded-lg -mx-3 px-3 py-2"><span class="hidden md:block text-3xl font-bold text-on-surface-variant leading-none flex-shrink-0">03</span><p class="font-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Secondary exit structuring for venture capital fund managers approaching end-of-fund life</p></li>
<li class="fund-point flex items-center gap-4 rounded-lg -mx-3 px-3 py-2"><span class="hidden md:block text-3xl font-bold text-on-surface-variant leading-none flex-shrink-0">04</span><p class="font-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Profitable ESOP liquidity programs for employees and ESOP holders seeking to convert vested options into cash</p></li>
</ul></div>
`,
  fpi: `
<h2 class="fund-anim fund-anim-1 font-headline-lg text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-primary mb-5">FPI Integration</h2>
<p class="fund-anim fund-anim-2 font-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-2">Helping global investors access India's private markets. Your partner for entering and exiting India's private markets.</p>
<p class="fund-anim fund-anim-2 font-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl leading-relaxed italic mb-12">We enable Foreign Portfolio Investors to participate seamlessly in India's high-growth private markets, navigating regulatory frameworks, custody requirements, and exit strategies with precision and speed.</p>
<div class="fund-anim fund-anim-3">
<h4 class="font-label-bold text-base font-bold text-primary-light mb-8 uppercase tracking-wider">Our Services</h4>
